# Pohjola UI recipe

Read **`docs/superpowers/specs/2026-08-31-page-architectures.md`** and **`docs/conventions/design-system.md`**.

- Do not invent navbar style, fonts, or layout variants.
- Feature views: one `PageTemplate` per page, slot records only (`ui-feature-views.mdc`).
- DaisyUI classes only inside `App.Ui.Templates.*` and `App.Ui` primitives.
- Source of truth is PureScript types + markers — not a JSON registry or a second frontend app.
